---
---
<section class="hero">
  <div>
    <span class="kicker">3D-Druck-Manufaktur · Appenzellerland</span>
    <h1>Du konfigurierst.<br /><span class="g">Wir drucken.</span></h1>
    <p class="sub">
      KohliLab baut Konfiguratoren für Dinge nach deinen Massen: QR-Schilder
      fürs Lokal, Schubladen-Organizer auf den Millimeter, und laufend mehr.
      Du gestaltest im Browser — gedruckt und geprüft wird in Bühler AR.
      Dazu Ventilkappen aus der KI-Mikrofabrik.
    </p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn primary" href="/#produkte">Zu den Konfiguratoren</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/ventilkappen">Zu den Ventilkappen</a>
    </div>
    <div class="specs">
      <div><div class="n">Nach Mass</div><div class="l">jedes Stück einzeln</div></div>
      <div><div class="n">Bis 4 Farben</div><div class="l">AMS-Mehrfarbdruck</div></div>
      <div><div class="n">Bühler AR</div><div class="l">gedruckt &amp; verschickt</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="stage">
    <div class="plate">
      <svg class="cap" width="230" height="230" viewBox="0 0 230 230" aria-label="KohliLab Konfiguratoren">
        <!-- QR-Schild -->
        <g transform="translate(18,26)">
          <rect x="0" y="0" width="92" height="64" rx="7" fill="#26282c" stroke="#e8e6e1" stroke-width="3.5"/>
          <g fill="#ff6b1a"><rect x="10" y="10" width="16" height="16"/><rect x="36" y="10" width="16" height="16"/><rect x="10" y="36" width="16" height="16"/><rect x="40" y="40" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="52" y="32" width="7" height="7"/></g>
          <path d="M64 16 h30 M64 26 h30 M64 40 h22" stroke="#9a9a93" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </g>
        <!-- Organizer -->
        <g transform="translate(118,112)">
          <rect x="0" y="0" width="94" height="70" rx="6" fill="#26282c" stroke="#e8e6e1" stroke-width="3.5"/>
          <path d="M34 0 v70 M34 34 h60 M64 34 v36 M0 22 h34" stroke="#ff6b1a" stroke-width="3.5"/>
        </g>
        <!-- Ventilkappe -->
        <g transform="translate(30,124)">
          <path d="M18 0 h34 v12 a17 17 0 0 1 -34 0 z" fill="#26282c" stroke="#e8e6e1" stroke-width="3.5"/>
          <path d="M35 32 v8 M24 40 h22" stroke="#e8e6e1" stroke-width="3.5" fill="none"/>
          <rect x="22" y="44" width="26" height="22" rx="3" fill="#26282c" stroke="#ff6b1a" stroke-width="3"/>
        </g>
      </svg>
      <span class="plabel">KOHLILAB · KONFIGURATOREN</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
